# Keep LF line endings in every checkout. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which writes CRLF. A CRLF shell script fails in MSYS2
# and Cygwin bash ($'\r': command not found), and the installer copies these
# files into ~/.claude/. macOS and Linux checkouts are LF already.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pyc binary
